{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And it is possible</b> that it is an explanation of ויצב. Now he had already set it up the first time, or he did so a second time — and the first is closer to me." "<b>And he poured a libation upon it.</b> Water or wine, and the meaning is that he washed it, and afterward he poured oil upon it. And in Beth El he fulfilled his vow and gave a tithe of his wealth for the honor of HaShem, to whoever in the generation was worthy to receive it."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:04.436344241Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}